    "identifier": "holes-of-despair",
    "description": "<p>You thrust your weapon out from different angles as you seek to riddle your opponent with holes. Make two melee taijutsu Attacks dealing your [Weapons damage] on hit.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: If you score at least one attack, affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining a rank of Bleeding on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, you can increase the number of attacks you make by +1.</p>",
